# 🏃 Vedanta Delhi Half Marathon 2026 — Training Plan

A personal 12-week half marathon training plan built for me, targeting a **Sub 2:30 finish** at the Vedanta Delhi Half Marathon 2026 (Virtual Event) on **October 18, 2026**.

---

## 🎯 Race Details

| Detail | Info |
|---|---|
| **Event** | Vedanta Delhi Half Marathon 2026 |
| **Category** | Virtual Half Marathon |
| **Distance** | 21.097 km |
| **Race Date** | Sunday, 18 October 2026 |
| **Goal** | Sub 2:30 (pace ~6:45 min/km) |
| **Baseline** | 10 km completed in 1:24 |

---

## 📋 What's Inside

A single-file interactive HTML training plan (`index.html`) that includes:

- **12-week day-by-day schedule** — click any week to see that week's full breakdown
- **4 training phases** — Base Build → Build & Threshold → Peak → Taper
- **Pace guide** — Easy, Tempo, Interval, Long Run, and Race pace targets
- **Race strategy tips** — hydration, sleep, taper, and HDOR app guidance
- **Mobile responsive** — works on phone, tablet, and desktop

---

## 🗂️ Files

```
vdhm-training-plan/
├── index.html      ← entire training plan (open this in any browser)
└── README.md       ← this file
```

No frameworks. No dependencies. No build step. Just open `index.html`.

---

## 🚀 Viewing the Plan

### Option 1 — GitHub Pages (live URL)
The plan is deployed at:
```
https://YOUR-USERNAME.github.io/vdhm-training-plan/
```
Bookmark this and access it from any device, anytime.

### Option 2 — Locally
Download `index.html` and open it in any browser. No internet needed.

---

## 📅 Training Phases at a Glance

| Phase | Weeks | Dates | Focus |
|---|---|---|---|
| 🟢 Base Build | 1–4 | Jul 25 – Aug 21 | Aerobic base, easy mileage, strides |
| 🟡 Build & Threshold | 5–8 | Aug 22 – Sep 18 | Tempo runs, intervals, long runs to 18 km |
| 🔴 Peak | 9–10 | Sep 19 – Oct 2 | Race-pace long runs, confidence |
| 🔵 Taper | 11–12 | Oct 3 – Oct 18 | Volume drops, legs stay fresh |

---

## 👟 Target Paces

| Run Type | Pace (min/km) |
|---|---|
| Easy / Recovery | 8:00 – 9:00 |
| Tempo / Threshold | 6:45 – 7:10 |
| Intervals | 6:00 – 6:30 |
| Long Run | 7:30 – 8:30 |
| **Race Target** | **~6:45** |

---

## 📱 Race Day — HDOR App

VDHM 2026 is a **virtual event**. To submit your official result:
1. Download the **HDOR app**
2. Log in with your registered email
3. Run 21.097 km on **October 18, 2026** with GPS tracking on
4. Submit your run through the app

---

## ✏️ Updating the Plan

To make changes:
1. Open `index.html` on GitHub
2. Click the **pencil (edit)** icon
3. Edit and **Commit changes**
4. Your live URL updates within ~30 seconds

---

*Built with pure HTML, CSS & JavaScript. No libraries required.*
